// Probe `tool-calls`: a scripted OpenAI-shaped stream folded by the real
// tools.collect / tools.finish / tools.parseArgs, then described by
// tools.summarise and gated by tools.needsApproval. `chunks` is the list of
// `delta.tool_calls` arrays as they arrived. Call ids are not scored: finish
// invents a random one when the provider sent none.
